// Same `Blink` shape as conjuration/misty_step.ron (the established
// player-spell pilot for this variant) -- no `energy_cost` field exists on
// this variant at all (confirmed in common/src/comp/ability.rs), so
// `cooldown` is the only balance lever. Sheet's own long-distance/plane-
// crossing/multi-companion framing collapses to the same short-range
// single-caster blink every other spell using this variant ships as --
// no cross-plane, long-distance-beyond-max_range, or multi-target
// teleport primitive exists (`common/src/states/blink.rs` moves only the
// caster, within `max_range`).
// Reviewer correction: cooldown 8.0 undercut every lower-level Blink
// sibling (thunder_step.ron L3/range27/cooldown18,
// vortex_warp.ron L2/range27/cooldown16) despite this being a strictly
// higher-level (L5) spell with a smaller range (18) than either. Raised
// to match thunder_step.ron's cooldown band.
Blink(
    buildup_duration: 0.35,
    recover_duration: 0.25,
    max_range: 18.0,
    frontend_specifier: None,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Conjuration),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        cooldown: Some(18.0),
        // level 5 spell -> min_level 30, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(30)),
    ),
)
